  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mi>&#969;t</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>&#956;F</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>If q represent the charge on capacitor&rsquo;s upper plate:<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Max charge <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>500</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br />Charge of upper plate at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />When capacitor is fully charged then charge on upper plate <math><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br />Voltage across capacitor when A and D are connected <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br />Total voltage across <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br />Current is anticlockwise",
